hell commands \u001b[25G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mPerfect! Now let me commit\u001b[30Gand\u001b[34Gpush\u001b[39Gthe\u001b[43Gfix.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;241mCommitted \u001b[1m98bc0da\u001b[22m, amended commit \u001b[1m21564b0\u001b[22m, pushed to \u001b[1mfix/slugify-bug\u001b[22m, ran \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[39m Done! Fixed the \u001b[38;5;105mslugify\u001b[39m function to handle consecutive\u001b[58Gand\u001b[62Gtrailing\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
