7G\u001b[38;5;105mtest_slugify_with_special_chars\u001b[59G\u001b[39mthat\u001b[64Gverifies\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;105mslugify(\"Hello, World!\")\u001b[39m returns \u001b[38;5;105m\"hello-world\"\u001b[39m. The test covers the exact\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbug that was fixed. Both\u001b[28Gthe fix\u001b[36Gand the test are now committed\u001b[67Gand\u001b[71G\u001b[K\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
